331	/**
332	 * Removes a repository entry from the registry.
333	 *
334	 * This operation does NOT delete any project data, files, or directories —
335	 * it only removes the declaration from `.repositories.json`.
336	 *
337	 * Throws NOT_FOUND (404) if no entry with the given `repoId` exists.
338	 *
339	 * @param ledgerRoot - Absolute path to the centralized ledger root directory.
